* 111–129
* DeFacto, JP1880, H&M, M&S, ASOS, EN 13402 özeti
---
* 3XL
* 116–141
* DeFacto, JP1880, H&M, M&S, ASOS, EN 13402 özeti
---
* 4XL
* 132–154
* DeFacto, JP1880, M&S, EN 13402 özeti
---
* 5XL
* 142–166
* DeFacto, JP1880, EN 13402 özeti
---
* 6XL
